@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Star Counter
+
+Physics puzzle game where players adjust star paths to launch miracles strategically.
+
+## How to Play
+Drag stars to set their trajectory, then launch miracles to maximize score. Reach 500 points to win!
