+# Changelog
+
+## [Alpha] - Fix Pass
+### Added
+- Complete HTML5 canvas implementation of Star Counter
+- Physics-based star movement with drag controls
+- Four miracle types: Speed, Split, Homing, Bomb
+- Score tracking with combo system
+- Win/lose states with overlay UI
+- Responsive design down to 360px
+- Keyboard and touch controls
+
